---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy & Google AdSense Disclosures | ToolsWaala";
const description = "Read ToolsWaala's privacy policy, cookie governance, Google AdSense disclosures, and client-side zero-logging guarantees.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} currentPath="/privacy-policy">
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20 text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">
    <header class="text-center mb-12 space-y-4">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 text-xs font-semibold">
        <span>🔒</span>
        <span>Privacy First Architecture & Ad Transparency</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">
        Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { month: 'long', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' })}
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white/80 dark:bg-slate-900/60 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl space-y-8 leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Zero File & Document Storage</h2>
        <p>
          At <strong>ToolsWaala (toolswaala.in)</strong>, user privacy is guaranteed by design. All file operations (PDF compression, image processing, resume generation, and invoice creation) are executed locally within your web browser using client-side JavaScript and WebAssembly.
        </p>
        <p>
          Your files, student marks, personal details, and client invoices are never uploaded to, transmitted across, or stored on our servers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: AdSense -->
      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising Policy</h2>
        <p>
          To maintain ToolsWaala as a 100% free digital resource for students and businesses without subscription fees or paywalls, we display advertisements served by trusted third-party networks, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 space-y-3 text-xs">
          <p><strong>• Cookie Utilization:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies (such as DoubleClick DART cookies) to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites on the internet.</p>
          <p><strong>• Personalized Advertising:</strong> Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve relevant ads to our users based on their visits to our site and/or other sites across the web.</p>
          <p><strong>• User Opt-Out Rights:</strong> Users may opt out of personalized advertising at any time by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 underline font-semibold">Google Ads Settings</a> or by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 underline font-semibold">www.aboutads.info</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Cookies & Local Storage -->
      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. Local Storage & Functional Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          ToolsWaala does not use tracking cookies to build personal behavioral profiles. We utilize minimal browser LocalStorage solely to remember your UI preferences (e.g. Dark Mode toggle or saved offline draft templates) so you can resume work seamlessly. Clearing your browser cache instantly wipes all local storage data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Analytics -->
      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Web Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We utilize standard, privacy-respecting analytics (such as Google Analytics 4) to monitor aggregate traffic patterns, browser types, and popular tools to improve server performance and user experience. No personally identifiable financial or academic data is ever captured.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 5: Contact -->
      <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or our Google AdSense compliance, please reach out via our <a href="/contact" class="text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400 font-bold underline">Contact Page</a> or via email at <code class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-950 rounded text-xs font-mono">support@toolswaala.in</code>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
